    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f1490bae-1e45-54f7-a223-93494eb90dfa" activityNameId="604c7f67-2646-5ce3-a347-90956ae7d2dd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, at production onshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, at production onshore
The onshore oil production delivers the product natural gas. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined onshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=b82f814a-f9f4-3901-b818-03a37e699d05
Production of natural gas including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for TM.
Technology: 26 % offshore and  74 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 57 billion Nm3 natural gas per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for onshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b82f814a-f9f4-3901-b818-03a37e699d05.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3a2b3531-c866-5075-ba62-212e945b1c1a" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
